    `the recipient did not or could not reasonably rely on the supplier` IS FALSE
    `the supplier has shown the recipient does not deal as consumer` IS FALSE
    `the supplier has shown the breach is so slight that rejection is unreasonable` IS FALSE
    `the contract shows an intention that the slight-breach rule not apply` IS FALSE

