§ `ss 1, 6, 18, 19`

#ASSERT NOT `it is a contract for the transfer of goods` `a sale of goods for money`
#ASSERT NOT `it is a contract for the transfer of goods` `a hire-purchase agreement`
#ASSERT `it is a contract for the transfer of goods` `a barter or part-exchange`
#ASSERT `it is a contract for the transfer of goods` `a contractor supplying materials with the work`
#ASSERT NOT `it is a contract for the transfer of goods` `a gift made by deed`
#ASSERT NOT `it is a contract for the transfer of goods` `a pledge or other security over goods`
#ASSERT NOT `it is a contract for the transfer of goods` `a rental or hire of goods`

#ASSERT `it is a contract for the hire of goods` `a rental or hire of goods`
#ASSERT NOT `it is a contract for the hire of goods` `a hire-purchase agreement`

#ASSERT `it is goods` `a household appliance`
#ASSERT NOT `it is goods` `money`
#ASSERT NOT `it is goods` `a share or debt (a thing in action)`
#ASSERT NOT `it is goods` `the land itself`

#ASSERT NOT `the Act applies to a contract made on that date` 19931111
#ASSERT `the Act applies to a contract made on that date` 19931112

§ `ss 2, 7`

#ASSERT `the title condition is breached` FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the title condition is breached` FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `the title condition is breached` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the title condition is breached` FALSE FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `the encumbrance warranty is breached` FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the encumbrance warranty is breached` FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `the encumbrance warranty is breached` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the encumbrance warranty is breached` TRUE FALSE FALSE

§ `ss 3-5, 8-10`

#ASSERT `the supplier is treated as acting in the course of a business` `a contractor's faulty water heater`
#ASSERT `the supplier is treated as acting in the course of a business` `an agent's trade-in for an undisclosed private owner`
#ASSERT NOT `the supplier is treated as acting in the course of a business` `an agent's trade-in for a disclosed private owner`

#ASSERT `the description condition is breached` `a private swap of goods not matching their description`
#ASSERT NOT `the description condition is breached` `a contractor's faulty water heater`

#ASSERT `the satisfactory quality condition is breached` `a contractor's faulty water heater`
#ASSERT NOT `the satisfactory quality condition is breached` `a private barter with a hidden defect`
#ASSERT NOT `the satisfactory quality condition is breached` `a car rental with the dent pointed out`
#ASSERT NOT `the satisfactory quality condition is breached` `a rental examined where the defect was obvious`
#ASSERT `the satisfactory quality condition is breached` `a rental examined where the defect was hidden`
#ASSERT `the satisfactory quality condition is breached` `an agent's trade-in for an undisclosed private owner`
#ASSERT NOT `the satisfactory quality condition is breached` `a private barter by sample with a defect the sample hid`

#ASSERT `the fitness for purpose condition is breached` `a hired generator unfit for the stated purpose`
#ASSERT NOT `the fitness for purpose condition is breached` `a hired generator where the hirer relied on own judgment`
#ASSERT NOT `the fitness for purpose condition is breached` `a neighbour's hired ladder unfit for the stated purpose`

#ASSERT `a downgradable sample condition is breached` `a private barter by sample where the bulk differs`
#ASSERT `a downgradable sample condition is breached` `a private barter by sample with a defect the sample hid`

#ASSERT `the opportunity to compare condition is breached` `a barter by sample with no chance to compare`

